AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000001> "A cell is a sample, which is an electronic device that converts the energy of light directly into electrical energy by using the photovoltaic effect."@en)
