AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000003> "a non photo-absorber layer that ensure contacting to the external electrical circuit situated at the back of a solar cell."@en)
