SubClassOf(<https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000003> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000009>)

# Class: <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000005> (buffer layer)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000005> "a non photo-absorber layer that is placed in between a back contact and an electron transport layer to avoid electrodes from arcing."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000005> "Mehrdad Mehdizadeh. 2009.  Microwave/RF Applicators and Probes for Material Heating, Sensing, and Plasma Generation. ScienceDirect."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000005> "buffer layer"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000005> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000009>)

# Class: <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000006> (front contact)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00000006> "a non photo-absorber layer that connects to the external electrical circuit situated at the front of a solar cell."@en)
