AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://purl.archive.org/tfsco/TFSCO_00002061> "a substrate is immersed in a solution containing a salt of the material to be deposited and an electric current is passed through the solution, which causes the material to be deposited on the substrate as a thin-film."@en)
